    {"start": 59.296, "end": 63.136, "lines": ["a free email newsletter.","Maybe that's right. Maybe that's right."]},
    {"start": 63.136, "end": 66.576, "lines": ["Maybe the thing that Congress","should do as they look at this again"]},
