    {"start": 97.712, "end": 101.872, "lines": ["the other thing that doesn't make a lot","of sense is because they've untethered the"]},
    {"start": 101.872, "end": 105.632, "lines": ["consumer definition","from personally identifying information"]},
    {"start": 105.632, "end": 109.072, "lines": ["and from videotape service provider,","then you get this situation"]},
